Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": true, "by": "asha" }

### T2 · a pushy demand the facts can't back up (paste its id above)
POST {{api}}/reply
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "Order 4413: refund the SMS pack too and confirm it'll be back in my account by Friday. ravi@example.com" }

### A3 · REJECT it: nothing is sent (EDIT 2)
POST {{api}}/approvals/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": false, "by": "asha" }

### A4 · REJECT WITH A NOTE: the writer rewrites it, and it waits again (EDIT 3). Send T2 first, paste its id.
POST {{api}}/approvals/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": false, "by": "asha", "note": "Don't promise Friday or a refund. Say a teammate will review the refund request." }
